sequenceDiagram
    participant App as App<br>[implements GapPeripheralResponse]
    participant Node as Node<br>[implements GapPeripheral]

    Note over App, Node: Allowed states: standby.<br>Calling outside standby asserts on the Node.<br>Pairing is allowed by default.<br>SetAllowPairing has no response callback.

    alt Disable pairing (reject new pairings)
        App->>Node: GapPeripheral.SetAllowPairing(false)
        Note over App, Node: New pairings blocked.<br>Bonded centrals can still connect and re-encrypt.
    else Re-enable pairing (default)
        App->>Node: GapPeripheral.SetAllowPairing(true)
        Note over App, Node: Restores the default after a previous<br>SetAllowPairing(false).
    end
